{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/109494-nikola-tesla-as-npc-especially-wraith","id":109494,"title":"Nikola Tesla as NPC (especially Wraith)?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-09T11:45:48-07:00","id":109494,"title":"Nikola Tesla as NPC (especially Wraith)?","content":"Hey Folks,<br /> <br /> I love the idea of including real (historical) people as NPCs in my games. I'm working on an idea now that might involve Nikola Tesla and a Wraith game. Has anyone ever made a character sheet for him? In any venue, but especially for Wraith? If there isn't a preexisting sheet (Canon or fan-produced), how about some brainstorming? <br /> <br /> What would The Greatest Geek Who Ever Lived have on his sheet?<br /> <br /> If a sheet exists somewhere, can someone send it to me, or link it here?<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2680-werebuffalo","name":"werebuffalo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2680_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T11:53:21-07:00","id":109504,"title":"","content":"I've heard of people doing what you propose, as Tesla was always a cool guy to reference.<br /> Okay I propose then a fun challenge for this thread where people could write up Tesla's Sheet in whatever manner they want. It would be a fun thought exercise to see how differently people stat him, and possibly alternate shadow histories of different versions of him!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T07:03:38-07:00","id":113297,"title":"","content":"GURPS had a CS for Tesla back in one of their 2nd or 3rd edition character books. It was interesting. I made up a Vampire sheet using him as a basis (to wit, I changed the name and dates, but kept the rest of the same.... oh, and he had Disciplines, of course). I'll try to find and post it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/426-big-brother","name":"Big Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}